Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:41.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's FICA? Why's he getting all my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:41.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁是社会安全税？ 为什么他拿走我所有的钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:45.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, what...? Chandler, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:45.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是怎么一回事？ 钱德，帮我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, this is not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这还算不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're fine, yeah, for a first job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，就第一份工作来说 你还算不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:58.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You can totally, totally live on this. MONICA: Oh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:58.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你可以靠它活下去 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:04:59.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, great service today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:04:59.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对了，今天服务很不错 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ooh.  - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 哦  - 哦，耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:02.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Terrific. - It was excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:02.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 太棒了 - 真的很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: Unbelievable. And all that milk and stuff? Great.
