Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:27.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
