Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们来这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:42.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we were in the city shopping, and your mom said you work here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:42.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来市区血拼 你妈说你在这里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:50.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at you in the apron. You look like you're in a play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:50.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看你穿围裙的样子 你看起来像是在演戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, look at you. You are so big. I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，看看你 你的肚子好大，我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I know. I'm a duplex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，我是一人吃两人补
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: So, what's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, guess who my dad's making partner in his firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猜猜我爸找谁当他的事务所合伙人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And while we're on the subject of news...
