Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:34.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll take a time-out while Messier stops to look at some women's shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:34.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要暂停一下 因为梅瑟停下来看女鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Carol was wearing boots just like those the night that we first...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡萝穿着一双类似那样的靴子 就在那晚我们第一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, she, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上她…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She never took them off. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她一直没脱鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:48.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's because we... Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:48.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我们…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:50.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:50.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:56.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Peach pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:56.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 桃子核
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:06:57.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, bunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:06:57.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Peach pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}桃子核
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That night, we, uh, had... - Peaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那晚我们吃了… - 蜜桃？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:06.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, nectarines, but basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:06.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是油桃才对，但基本上来说都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Could've been a peach. - Then we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 算是蜜桃 - 然后我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then we got dressed and I walked her to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们穿好衣服，我陪她走到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the bus stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}公车站
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:21.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, that woman's got an ass like Carol's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:21.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那女人的屁股跟卡萝很像
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:29.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I thought we were trying to find stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:29.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？ 我以为我们在找跟她有关的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on, you guys. Tell me all the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧，各位 告诉我所有的八卦消息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:37.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the biggest news is still you dumping Barry at the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:37.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最大的八卦消息 还是你在婚礼上甩了贝瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:43.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right, let's talk reality for a second. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:43.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吧，来谈一下现实问题 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- When are you coming home? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你何时要回家？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:46.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:46.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位，我不回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:51.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Heh. Come on. This is us. - I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:51.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 少来了，你是在跟我们说 - 我不回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:55.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is what I'm doing now. I've got this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:55.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我现在的生活 我找到这份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Waitressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当服务生？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. I'm not just waitressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不只是当服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I write the specials on the specials board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在特餐具公告栏写特餐消息
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:13.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I take the dead flowers out of the vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:13.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将枯掉的花从花瓶拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:18.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, oh, and sometimes Arturo lets me put the little chocolate blobbies on the cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:18.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候阿杜洛会让我 将小巧克力块放在饼干上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:21.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, your mom didn't tell us about the blobbies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:21.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你妈妈没跟我们提小巧克力块的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Hey, Rach. How was it with your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，你跟你的朋友聊得还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:42.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, how would you like some Tiki Death Punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:42.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啊 你要喝点鸡尾酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:43.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:43.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:46.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, it's rum and... - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:46.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我加了兰姆酒跟… - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We thought since Phoebe's staying over we'd have a slumber party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们想既然菲比要留下来过夜 我们要办个睡衣派对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:55.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We got some trashy magazines, we got cookie dough, we got Twister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:55.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们买了八卦杂志 还有饼干跟扭扭乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:59.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, ooh. And I brought Operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:59.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我带了手术游戏来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:03.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I lost the tweezers, so we can't operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:03.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但镊子不见了，没办法动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:06.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we can prep the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:06.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们能帮病人做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, it's the Visa-card people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，是信用卡公司打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:12.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God. Ask them what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:12.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，问他们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:16.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you please tell me what this is in reference to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:16.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请问有何贵事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的，请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, they say there's been unusual activity on your account.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说你的账户有异常活动
