Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, they wanna know if I'm okay. Okay, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，他们想知道我是否没事 让我想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:38.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, let's see. The FICA guys took all my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:38.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我想一想 社会安全税拿走我所有的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:42.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone I know is either getting married or getting pregnant or getting promoted...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:42.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认识的人不是结婚 怀孕就是升官了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I'm getting coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在端咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:46.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it's not even for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:46.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是我要喝的咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:49.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if that sounds like I'm okay, okay, then you can tell them I'm okay. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:49.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果那听起来像是我很好 跟他们说我很好，好吗？
