Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? There was ice there that night with Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？ 你那晚跟卡萝也看到冰了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:23.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plastic seats? Four thousand angry Pittsburgh fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:23.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}塑胶椅？ 四千名愤怒的匹兹堡球迷？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, actually, I was just saying it looks like we're not sitting together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我是说看起来 我们没办法坐在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But now that you mention it, there was ice there that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然你都提起了 那晚的确跟冰有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was the first frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那晚是初霜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:38.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We were... - Sit. Just sit down. Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:38.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们… - 坐吧，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:39.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:39.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该觉得很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're doing this amazing independent thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在独立过生活
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, what is so amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，那有什么好的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:49.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gave up like everything. And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:49.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我放弃了一切，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are just like Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟杰克一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jack from downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}楼下的杰克？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:56.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Jack and the Beanstalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:56.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，《杰克与魔豆》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ah, the other Jack. - Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 另一个杰克 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, he gave up something, but then he got those magic beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，他放弃一些事，得到魔豆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:07.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then he woke up and there was this big plant...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:07.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他醒过来，看到一大棵植物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...outside of his window, full of possibilities and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在他家窗户外面 充满了无限的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:15.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he lived in a village, and you live in the Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:15.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他住在小村子里，你住在村区
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, but, Pheebs, Pheebs, Jack gave up a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了，菲比，杰克放弃一头牛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gave up an orthodontist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我放弃一位牙齿矫正师
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I know I didn't love him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我知道我不爱他，可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, see, Jack did love the cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧，杰克爱那头牛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:30.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, see, it was a plan, you know? It was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:30.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的计划，你知道吗？ 一切是那么清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everything was figured out, and now everything's just kind of like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切都已经安排好了，现在是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:36.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Flupie? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:36.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 一片混乱？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:40.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not the only one. We don't know where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:40.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只是你 我们也不知道自己要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:43.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gotta figure, at some point, it's gonna come together...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:43.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}终有一天你会知道 情况会变得清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and it's just gonna be "unflupie."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不再混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:47.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, like that's a word.
