Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, because you just... I don't like this question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你…我不喜欢这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:07.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, see? See, you guys? What if we don't get magic beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:07.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧，如果我们找不到魔豆呢？
