Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给他好看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get... Yes! You're not laughing now, are you, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了，你笑不出来了吧？兄弟
