Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不满意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:11.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, it's kind of an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:11.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，这是紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess you'd know that, or we'd be in the predicament room.
