Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:55.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起，我无意拉你们下水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，你说得对
